STEP 1 — ASK A QUESTION
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Ask a Question
Message: "What is your order number?"
↓
STEP 2 — FORMULA
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Formulas
Action: ticket_outcome = "order_status_demo"
↓
STEP 3 — MESSAGE
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Messages
Message: "Let's help you track your order."
↓
STEP 4 — ASK FOR EMAIL
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Ask for an Email
Message: "Please enter the email used for this order."
↓
STEP 5 — SET A FIELD
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Set a Field
Action: eta = 2024-06-22 (estimated delivery date)
↓
STEP 6 — FORMULA (Status Check)
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Formulas
Action: order_status = "Shipped"
↓
STEP 7 — FORMULA (ETA Calculation)
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Formulas
Action: eta = ToString(AddDays(Today(),2))
↓
STEP 8 — MESSAGE (Status Result)
─────────────────────────────────────────────
Node: Messages
Message: "Order Status: @order_status
          Estimated Delivery: @eta"

    PATH A — Order Found (Teal line)
    ↓
    STEP 9A — FORMULA
    ──────────────────────────────────
    Node: Formulas
    Action: ticket_outcome = "order_status_resolved"
    ↓
    STEP 10A — FORMULA (Timestamp)
    ──────────────────────────────────
    Node: Formulas
    Action: ticket_timestamp = ToString(Now())
    ↓
    STEP 11A — ZAPIER
    ──────────────────────────────────
    Node: Zapier — Integrate with Zapier
    Action: Logs resolved ticket to support system
    ↓
    STEP 12A — CSAT RATING
    ──────────────────────────────────
    Node: Buttons
    Message: "How would you rate your support
              experience today? (1=Poor, 5=Great)"
    Options: 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | Any of the above
    ↓
    STEP 13A — ZAPIER (per rating)
    ──────────────────────────────────
    Node: Zapier — Integrate with Zapier
    Action: Logs CSAT score
    ↓
    STEP 14A — MESSAGE (Thank You)
    ──────────────────────────────────
    Node: Messages
    Message: "Thank you for your feedback!
              Feel free to start a new request anytime."
    → END

    PATH B — Order Not Found (Red/Pink line)
    ↓
    STEP 9B — MESSAGE (Error)
    ──────────────────────────────────
    Node: Messages
    Message: "Something went wrong in the demo flow.
              Please return to the main menu."
    → RESTART to Welcome Menu
